<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
  <title>My Favourite Animals</title>
</head>

<body>

  <center>

    <h1>My Favourite Animals Webpage</h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to my webpage! Here you can see beautiful
      animals, listen to music, and watch an animal video.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Animal Picture Gallery</h2>

    <p>These are some of my favourite animals.</p>

    <img src="lion.jpg"
         alt="A lion in the wild"
         width="250" height="200">

    <img src="elephant.jpg"
         alt="An elephant"
         width="250" height="200">

    <img src="dog.jpg"
         alt="A friendly dog"
         width="250" height="200">

    <hr>

    <h2>My Favourite Music</h2>

    <p>Click the play button to listen to music.</p>

    <audio controls loop>
      <source src="music.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
      Your browser does not support audio.
    </audio>

    <hr>

    <h2>Animal Video</h2>

    <p>Watch this video to learn about animals.</p>

    <video width="500" height="300" controls poster="lion.jpg">
      <source src="animals.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support video.
    </video>

    <hr>

    <h2>Thank You for Visiting!</h2>

    <p>
      I used HTML image, audio, and video tags
      to create my webpage.
    </p>

  </center>

</body>

</html>
